					"id": 80030602,
					"content": "#呜…{NICKNAME}，别这么伤心…我们会找到他们的！往好的一面想吧！这次至少已经找到很有用的线索了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030603,
						80030605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030603,
					"content": "我…没有伤心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030604,
					"content": "欸？真的吗？唔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030607,
					"content": "总之，以目前的情形而言，寻找亲人的突破口，除了「七神」以外，又多了一个「戴因」吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030608,
						80030609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030608,
					"content": "我们去稻妻以后，也需要多留意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030610,
					"content": "没错。对了，他们刚才说的话好难懂，你听明白了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030611,
						80030612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030611,
					"content": "差不多明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030613,
					"content": "唔…那我们来稍微梳理一下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030614,
					"content": "#首先是那个深渊使徒，它把你的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SISTER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}叫做「{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_GIRLD|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BOYD]}」殿下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030615,
					"content": "#看来你的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SISTER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}正在统领深渊教团，而且地位比深渊使徒更高…虽然不知道是不是最高的统治者就是了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030616,
					"content": "#还有，你{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SISTER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}说{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_HE]}的目标是「淹没神座、与天理作战」。这是什么意思呢？听起来…是不是要覆灭七神与七国？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030617,
					"content": "然后，深渊教团的怪物，就是坎瑞亚灭国时的人民…扭曲成的怪物。这真是可怕的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030618,
					"content": "戴因也是坎瑞亚人，五百年前也经历了那一切。但他没有变成怪物，而且在五百年后的今天，正对抗着深渊教团…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030619,
					"content": "#也就是，你的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SISTER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}说的，「戴因正在与{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_HE]}为敌」的意思吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030620,
					"content": "但是，如果深渊教团的怪物，是当年戴因守护的人民，那为什么戴因要与深渊教团敌对呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030621,
					"content": "#另外，为什么…我一直在陪你寻找的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_HE]}，现在却和深渊教团的怪物站在一起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030622,
						80030623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030622,
					"content": "情报并不太多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030624,
					"content": "嗯，没错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030625,
					"content": "#那——{NICKNAME}，打起精神来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030626,
					"content": "我们的旅行不会结束，该动身了！离开这个讨厌的地方，先回到阳光照耀的地面上去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030627,
					"content": "#如果你的{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SISTER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}要你「抵达终点」…好啊，那你就抵达给{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_SHE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_HE]}看！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030628,
					"content": "「旅行者」，我们走吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030623,
					"content": "再多想也没意义了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030612,
					"content": "#注意力只在{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_YING|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BROTHER]}身上，没仔细听。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030609,
					"content": "「旅行」的目标又多了一个。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030605,
					"content": "派蒙说得没错，希望已经出现了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030606
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030606,
					"content": "嗯，是吧是吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}